// Public Suffix List — CURATED SUBSET for cert-monitor domain-expiry (eTLD+1 extraction).
// Format = publicsuffix.org syntax: '//' comment, plain rule, '*.' wildcard, '!' exception.
// This is a curated subset (multi-level suffixes + notable ccTLDs). Any TLD not listed here
// falls back to the PSL default rule '*' (public suffix = last label → registrable = last 2 labels),
// which is correct for single-level TLDs. Replace with the full official list if broader coverage is needed.
// Source of truth: https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat

